text = "MOVEMENT
Space - Dodge Roll: brief invincibility while rolling, costs stamina

COMBAT
LMB / RMB - Attack: chain hits into a combo for more damage & knockback
Q - Ranged Attack: fires a projectile in your facing direction, costs stamina

STAMINA
Powers attacks, dodge rolls and ranged shots. Regenerates after a short
pause since you last spent it.

HEALING GOURD
H - Heal: limited charges, takes a moment to channel and can be
interrupted (wasting the charge) if you get hit while healing

BONFIRE
Stand near one and press E to rest: full heal, refill stamina and heal
charges, and set your respawn point for when you die

Press I again to close"
